  "body": "### ESLint version\n\nv10.9.1\n\n### What problem do you want to solve?\n\nPlease update file-entry-cache dependency (and keyv transitive dependency as well) to newest version.\n\nI need to use newest version of keyv in my project.\n\n\u2502 \u251c\u2500\u252c @nestjs/cache-manager@3.1.3\n\u2502 \u2502 \u2514\u2500\u2500 keyv@5.6.0\n\u2502 \u2514\u2500\u252c cache-manager@7.2.9\n\u2502   \u251c\u2500\u252c @cacheable/utils@2.5.0\n\u2502   \u2502 \u2514\u2500\u2500 keyv@5.6.0\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 keyv@5.6.0\n\u2514\u2500\u252c eslint@10.9.1\n  \u2514\u2500\u252c file-entry-cache@8.0.0\n    \u2514\u2500\u252c flat-cache@4.0.1\n      \u2514\u2500\u2500 keyv@4.5.4\n\n### What do you think is the correct solution?\n\nUpdate the dependency and release new version.\n\n### Participation\n\n- [ ] I am willing to submit a pull request for this change.\n\n### AI acknowledgment\n\n- [ ] I did not use AI to generate this issue report.\n- [ ] (If the above is not checked) I have reviewed the AI-generated content before submitting.\n\n### Additional comments\n\n_No response_",
